sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as API server
    participant E as etcd
    participant C as Controllers
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant K as Managed Karpenter
    participant N as Kubelet

    U->>A: Create Deployment
    A->>A: Authenticate, authorize, admit
    A->>E: Store desired state
    C->>A: Create ReplicaSet and Pod
    S->>A: Find suitable node
    alt No available capacity
      K->>A: Observe unschedulable Pod
      K->>K: Select instance type and AZ
      K-->>A: Register node
    end
    S->>A: Bind Pod to node
    N->>A: Watch assigned Pod
    N->>N: Pull image and start container
    N-->>A: Report readiness
